# Throwaway screenshots dropped at repo root during chat sessions.
# Globbed, not enumerated: `image2.png` slipped past `/image.png` and
# `/image-*.png`, and this repo is going open source — a screenshot that
# lands in history is not something a later commit can take back.
/image*.png
/image*.jpg
/image*.jpeg
/screenshot*.png
/screenshot*.jpg
/Captura*.png
/*.pasted.png

